OL,3,A'I applied for 200 jobs' - How 'spray
OL,4,Aand pray' AI job applications can
OL,5,Abackfire
OL,6,
OL,7,FWould you use AI to help you write a CV
OL,8,For cover letter? How about during an
OL,9,Fonline assessment or video interview
OL,10,Ffor a job?
OL,12,FWe are increasingly using the
OL,13,Ftechnology to help us with job
OL,14,Fapplications, graduates and recruiters
OL,15,Fsay, with many employers happy for us
OL,16,Fto do so within reason.
OL,18,FBut when does it cross a line from
OL,19,Fbeing acceptable to unethical, or even
OL,20,Fcheating?
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
