OL,3,AAt the Brooklyn novelty shop in
OL,4,A'surreal' row with Kelly Clarkson over
OL,5,Amechanical bird
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn a rainy Wednesday afternoon, a
OL,8,Fnovelty toy and games store in a quiet
OL,9,Fpart of New York City was seeing much
OL,10,Fbusier foot traffic than usual.
OL,12,FInside, the shop was packed with
OL,13,Fcameramen and customers, while
OL,14,Fpassersby in this Brooklyn
OL,15,Fneighbourhood of Cobble Hill looked
OL,16,Finside, asking: "Where's the bird?"
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/18
